{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"3570a247f6778b9aeaa2ad503b8da3b99159f2653e4a7ad154e91fc61c51db14","ja":"好きな本のラスト","zh":"最喜欢的书的结尾","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"e223e2af8bbdf5862e736fe211f9d01866608230e80092f732e93374bd6ac92e","ja":"はあ～、来週の今ごろは……\nああっ！　どうしよう……！","zh":"唉～，下周这个时候……\n啊啊！怎么办才好……！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"885736b2248434e42da54ab22e58f383ad9ef89a9ea55b79203f35fe034e8421","ja":"ユリコ、どうしてそんなにソワソワしてるのです？\nカレンダーにプロブレムがあるのですか？","zh":"百合子，你为什么这么坐立不安呢？\n是日历上有什么问题吗？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"330cb9c731140038efe70e00e175a42c456219c47f4ff02f2aff7af08a614f8e","ja":"あっ……ごめん、気になるよね。実は来週、\n私の大好きなシリーズの最新刊が出るんだけど……。","zh":"啊……抱歉，让你在意了吧。其实下周，\n我非常喜欢的那部系列的最新卷就要发售了……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"3b0d1f64e442c4a31332ed5ae375b3f23308bcd2360ed36bf38fdb3fa1da9ecd","ja":"それが最終巻なの！\nだから、ずっと落ち着かなくて！","zh":"那就是最终卷啊！\n所以，我一直都静不下心来！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"db459a85f8e2b32bb8aed5d9f884f5ec5c331296360ae4d903d548f32d29dab4","ja":"お話への期待と、終わってしまう寂しさとで、\nいてもたってもいられないっていうか……。","zh":"对故事的期待，以及迎来尾声的落寞交织在一起，\n总觉得有些坐立不安……。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"fd0969dd4347c434c837ca44700022ad96ea4b0295542ce98742be4a313c897b","ja":"なるほど、そういうことでしたか。それじゃあ、\nそのドキドキをハッピーにカスタマイズしましょう♪","zh":"原来是这么回事啊。那么，\n就把这份紧张悸动改造成快乐幸福吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"20ee5143faa3577f2fe1a97e15844cb7bacc1fcfae3553cbd3cd825c9b52babc","ja":"ハッピーにカスタマイズ……？\nそれって、どういうこと？","zh":"定制出幸福……？\n那是什么意思？","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"8b1d21a02e212d0c7aa721ae109c11666c83623f5ea824167191a5f37681142b","ja":"ロコとユリコで、ストーリーのラストを\nディスカッションしてみるんです！","zh":"和ROCO还有百合子一起，\n讨论一下故事的结局吧！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"30edb8bb33ddf8938d69955dad2014be8b59b70ed9474c1bb928430bbb645a74","ja":"他のことにコンセントレイトすれば、\nソワソワしなくて済みますし……。","zh":"只要把注意力集中在别的事情上，\n就不会静不下心了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5dd232de2985aecae5f1f78def45b435b7b5b1ada5642bb99f456a15b23a61c2","ja":"最終巻でアンサーチェックできるって思えば\nきっと、発売まで楽しく待つことができますよ！","zh":"只要想到最终卷里能对答案，\n发售前的等待一定也会充满乐趣的！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"c7f051f07cb7129d3622fadddb0cf4cded04f2ddf0363bba222fc2041e91f8d0","ja":"なるほど……うん、面白そうかも！\n私、やってみたい！","zh":"原来如此……嗯，好像挺有趣的！\n我想试试看！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"7254a1e560203694ba27b56c6bed744200446a5d6bea20270a9ac9dddc743e6b","ja":"それじゃあ、まずはストーリーの説明からね。\n主人公は、ある魔法書を探すために旅をしてるの。","zh":"那么，首先从故事的说明开始吧。\n主角为了寻找某本魔法书，正在踏上旅途。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[16].text","source_sha256":"1b54e5022b4781c82aa87639209aaa67336c621d0ed849b5103dddd09128838f","ja":"だけど、もちろん一筋縄ではいかなくて、\n他にも魔法書を狙っている敵がたくさんいて……♪","zh":"但是，事情当然没那么简单，\n还有很多同样觊觎着魔法书的敌人……♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1538.unity3d","item_key":"commands[17].text","source_sha256":"e386adf426f24e2e87d11448c473e0da77885b1aef118aef5e5c313a1cdd4b8a","ja":"ふむふむ。とってもインタレスティングな\nストーリーの予感がします！","zh":"嗯嗯。感觉会是一个\n非常有趣的故事呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:41:25+00:00"}
